invariant: INV-16
file: src/chacha20_vector.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh vector-neon
reason: the last row of the NEON block in general registers leaves the
  counter out of the input it adds back, so word 12 of that block's
  keystream differs from RFC 8439 §2.3's. bin/chacha20_equiv_test
  compares every byte of the output with chacha20.c's.

--- old
    uint32_t word_12 = row == 3 ? counter : 0;
--- new
    uint32_t word_12 = row == 4 ? counter : 0;
